      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/lake_como_florida",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The surrounding landscape is a mosaic of pine flatwoods, oak hammocks, and freshwater wetlands, reflecting the region's longleaf pine dominance.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
