      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Historically, the area was inhabited by the Timucua people before European contact in the 16th century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/lake_como_florida",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In the 1850s and 1860s, pioneers settled along the Johns River, attracted by fertile soils suitable for farming.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
